          "id": "i-claim-exemption-from-withholding-for-2026-and-",
          "label": "I claim exemption from withholding for 2026, and I certify that I meet both of the conditions for exemption for 2026. See Exemption from withholding on page 2. I understand I will need to submit a new Form W-4 for 2027",
